      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: Im currently using the 2017.4.15f1 with the Most Recent SDK... the 2019.04.01.10.09 SDK.. First time gives me a Stuck at \"Preparing for Upload\"... Did a New Fresh Project to fix it... and now when i upload... It successfully render the Version 1.0 of the world.. without any Texture added.. just colors.. i went back into Updating it with Shaders and Textures... Re-uploaded it... Still Showing me the Version 1.0 instead of Updated version... I tracked the source of the Model, Deleted the Temp, Cleared the VRChat Cache, all that... Re-uploaded in New Instances... Did a Test, It sends me Home instead of the World.. Tried going to the world from the Menu... Still sends me home instead...",
